              highlighted: ["sCD","sOa","pRO","MX"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "AB = BT, CD = DX", ref: "XI.29" }, { ref: "XI.30" }] },
            { text: "therefore the solid {BT|sFV} also equals the solid {DX|sOa}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["sFV","sOa"] },
            { text: "Therefore the base {FK|pFK} is to the base {OR|pRO} as the height of the solid {DX|sOa} is to the height of the solid {BT|sFV}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pFK","pRO","MX","GT"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "FK : OR = height DX : height BT", ref: "Above" }] },
            { text: "But the base {FK|pFK} equals the base {EH|pEH}, and the base {OR|pRO} equals the base {NQ|pNQ},",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pFK","pEH","pRO","pNQ"] },
            { text: "therefore the base {EH|pEH} is to the base {NQ|pNQ} as the height of the solid {DX|sOa} is to the height of the solid {BT|sFV}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pEH","pNQ","MX","GT"] },
            { text: "But the solids {DX|sOa} and {BT|sFV} and the solids {DC|sCD} and {BA|sAB} have the same heights respectively,",
