              highlighted: ["sOa","sFV","sCD","sAB","MX","GT"] },
            { text: "therefore the base {EH|pEH} is to the base {NQ|pNQ} as the height of the solid {DC|sCD} is to the height of the solid {AB|sAB}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pEH","pNQ","MX","GT"] },
            { text: "Therefore in the parallelepipedal solids {AB|sAB} and {CD|sCD} the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["sAB","sCD"] },
            { text: "Next, in the parallelepipedal solids {AB|sAB} and {CD|sCD} let the bases be reciprocally proportional to the heights,",
