              highlighted: ["sAB","sCD"] },
            { text: "that is, as the base {EH|pEH} is to the base {NQ|pNQ},",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pEH","pNQ"] },
            { text: "so let the height of the solid {CD|sCD} be to the height of the solid {AB|sAB}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["MX","GT"] },
            { text: "I say that the solid {AB|sAB} equals the solid {CD|sCD}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["sAB","sCD"] },
            { text: "With the same construction, since the base {EH|pEH} is to the base {NQ|pNQ}",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pEH","pNQ"] },
            { text: "as the height of the solid {CD|sCD} is to the height of the solid {AB|sAB},",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["MX","GT"] },
            { text: "and the base {EH|pEH} equals the base {FK|pFK}, and {NQ|pNQ} equals {OR|pRO},",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pEH","pFK","pNQ","pRO"] },
            { text: "therefore the base {FK|pFK} is to the base {OR|pRO} as the height of the solid {CD|sCD} is to the height of the solid {AB|sAB}.",
