              justifications: [{ claim: "BT = BA, DX = DC", ref: "XI.29" }, { ref: "XI.30" }] },
            { text: "Therefore the solid {AB|sAB} also equals the solid {CD|sCD}.",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["sAB","sCD"] },
            { text: "Therefore, in equal parallelepipedal solids the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights;",
              visible: SOL1,
              highlighted: ["pEH","pNQ","GT","MX"] },
            { text: "and those parallelepipedal solids in which the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights are equal.",
